"""
Ryoku-WE

Unified Ryoku wallpaper support + TUI.

Validated routing:
  Pictures / stills        -> native Ryoku
  Local GIFs               -> native Ryoku + AnimatedImage patch
  Local videos             -> native Ryoku
  Steam Workshop videos    -> native Ryoku
  Wallpaper Engine scenes  -> we-layerd
  Wallpaper audio          -> global mute/unmute toggle

Run with no arguments to open the TUI.

CLI commands (also used internally by systemd):
  install
  repair
  status
  sync
  gif-patch
  mute
  unmute
  toggle-mute
  restart-we
  picker
  logo
  uninstall
"""

